/* ===================================================================
   Pixieset block layouts — extracted, not reinvented.

   Every migrated page kept Pixieset's class names but lost its
   stylesheet (it shipped the cookie banner, GTM and Sentry with it),
   which is why blocks collapsed or stretched. This file is generated
   from Pixieset's own published stylesheets — theme_12 and the flex
   page builder — keeping only the selectors that match classes present
   in the imported markup, plus the site's own layout variables.

   Everything is scoped under .post-body so it cannot reach the site's
   header, footer, galleries or homepage. font-family declarations are
   stripped, so the site keeps its own typography (Fraunces / Work Sans).

   Regenerate with /tmp/info/extract_css.py after re-importing content.
   =================================================================== */

